WEBVTT

00:01.772 --> 00:05.392
<b>Why do you not kill me?</b>

00:07.492 --> 00:11.112
<b>Let me ask you this, as well: why did 
you not fight with the intent to kill?</b>

00:11.452 --> 00:12.622
<b>What?</b>

00:12.622 --> 00:15.722
<b>The other Insects that came 
from the Underworld Gate</b>

00:15.722 --> 00:17.662
<b>are desperate to take over this world.</b>

00:19.022 --> 00:22.912
<b>Yes, that is our most ardent wish.</b>

00:24.122 --> 00:26.122
<b>You are hesitant.</b>

00:26.122 --> 00:29.092
<b>Could it be that you're 
opposed to that goal?</b>

00:30.432 --> 00:32.632
<b>The Underworld is impoverished.</b>

00:33.182 --> 00:37.522
<b>We have no future unless we 
take over the mortal world.</b>

00:38.052 --> 00:42.152
<b>But I do not understand it.</b>

00:42.822 --> 00:44.402
<b>Hey, Gran...</b>

00:44.402 --> 00:45.242
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:46.332 --> 00:49.232
<b>I don't dislike oddballs like you.</b>

00:49.232 --> 00:52.072
<b>What do you say to coming with us?</b>

00:52.852 --> 00:54.812
<b>Go... with you?</b>

00:55.612 --> 00:57.572
<b>Me? An Insect?</b>

00:57.912 --> 00:59.322
<b>Is that so strange?</b>

00:59.322 --> 01:04.572
<b>We need to leave from here on 
a long journey to the west.</b>

01:05.552 --> 01:09.062
<b>So we'd like to have some 
allies we can trust.</b>

01:09.642 --> 01:11.382
<b>What is your name?</b>

01:11.942 --> 01:13.712
<b>I have no name.</b>

01:13.712 --> 01:17.402
<b>Oh? Then I'll give you one.</b>

01:22.722 --> 01:23.862
<b>Right!</b>

01:23.862 --> 01:26.982
<b>From now on, your name is Razul.</b>

01:28.772 --> 01:34.202
<b>Whoa... That took a lot out of me.</b>

01:35.372 --> 01:38.262
<b>I'm Maria, and this is...</b>

01:38.262 --> 01:39.432
<b>Gran.</b>

01:39.432 --> 01:41.032
<b>Glad to know you, Razul.</b>

01:42.542 --> 01:45.022
<b>Gran... Maria...</b>

03:14.552 --> 03:16.002
<b>That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime
Season 4</b>

03:16.002 --> 03:21.052
<b>Episode 95: Granville's Hope</b>

03:16.922 --> 03:19.902
<b><i>I'm saving Chloe and Hinata's souls.</i></b>

03:19.902 --> 03:22.892
<b><i>If I intervene with their souls 
while they sleep inside Chronoa</i></b>

03:22.892 --> 03:27.262
<b><i>and speak to them through Thought 
Communication, maybe I can wake them.</i></b>

03:28.022 --> 03:30.062
<b><i>But... how?</i></b>

03:30.062 --> 03:32.282
<b><i>What are my odds of success?</i></b>

03:33.152 --> 03:37.702
<b><i>There is a way to further solidify
your plan's chance of success.</i></b>

03:38.382 --> 03:41.022
<b><i>I wanted to relay that to you.</i></b>

03:41.502 --> 03:42.752
<b><i>And what is it?</i></b>

03:42.752 --> 03:46.492
<b><i>Right, if you take the form of your 
spiritual body while maintaining contact</i></b>

03:46.492 --> 03:48.502
<b><i>between your physical bodies,</i></b>

03:48.502 --> 03:51.752
<b><i>you can enter the other being's body.</i></b>

03:52.112 --> 03:56.012
<b><i>Then, if your astral 
bodies come into contact,</i></b>

03:56.372 --> 04:00.422
<b><i>you can directly intervene 
with the other being's soul.</i></b>

04:02.652 --> 04:07.052
<b>That sounds like I'd risk getting stuck in 
there and never being able to come back...</b>

04:07.052 --> 04:11.442
<b><i>Raphael-sensei, can I not just talk 
to them with Thought Communication?</i></b>

04:11.902 --> 04:12.882
<b><i>Answer.</i></b>

04:12.882 --> 04:16.972
<b><i>The suggestion from the individual 
named Diablo is more likely to succeed.</i></b>

04:16.972 --> 04:20.992
<b><i>However, the danger level 
is also incomparably higher.</i></b>

04:20.992 --> 04:21.872
<b><i>Got it.</i></b>

04:22.192 --> 04:25.502
<b><i>Thanks, Diablo. 
Let me just say one thing, though.</i></b>

04:25.502 --> 04:27.522
<b><i>Yes? What is it?</i></b>

04:27.522 --> 04:30.292
<b><i>You seriously overestimate me.</i></b>

04:31.712 --> 04:33.782
<b><i>You are being too modest.</i></b>

04:33.782 --> 04:36.592
<b><i>Well, I wish you luck, Great Rimuru.</i></b>

04:36.592 --> 04:38.862
<b>I'm not being modest.</b>

04:38.862 --> 04:42.432
<b>Anyway, how can I get 
Chronoa to calm down?</b>

04:42.752 --> 04:45.292
<b><i>I can't make contact with that.</i></b>

04:45.292 --> 04:47.792
<b><i>Why not try using the 
magic-suppressing mask?</i></b>

04:47.792 --> 04:48.882
<b>Charys?!</b>

04:48.882 --> 04:50.872
<b><i>Crap! I said that out loud!</i></b>

04:50.872 --> 04:54.302
<b><i>Wait, so you figured out 
what I was thinking, too?</i></b>

04:54.302 --> 04:58.192
<b><i>That mask was powerful 
enough to keep me sealed.</i></b>

04:58.192 --> 05:01.822
<b><i>I feel that it may also 
help to quiet her spirit.</i></b>

05:02.132 --> 05:03.632
<b><i>I get it.</i></b>

05:03.632 --> 05:07.832
<b><i>Maybe the mask Chloe inherited 
from Shizu-san can...</i></b>

05:07.832 --> 05:11.712
<b><i>Hang on. Where </i>is<i> that mask now, anyway?</i></b>

05:12.302 --> 05:14.902
<b><i>If it came back to the past with Chloe,</i></b>

05:14.902 --> 05:18.802
<b><i>would it end up back with Shizu-san again?</i></b>

05:18.802 --> 05:22.282
<b><i>So where did that mask come 
from in the first place, then?</i></b>

05:22.842 --> 05:25.382
<b><i>No, I can think about that later.</i></b>

05:25.382 --> 05:28.252
<b><i>Raphael-sensei, 
can you reproduce that mask?</i></b>

05:28.252 --> 05:29.032
<b><i>Answer.</i></b>

05:29.032 --> 05:32.002
<b><i>Would you like to create a replica 
of the magic-suppressing mask?</i></b>

05:32.002 --> 05:33.012
<b>Yes.</b>

05:36.712 --> 05:39.282
<b><i>Help me, Shizu-san.</i></b>

05:41.162 --> 05:45.102
<b><i>Now I just need to wait for them 
to create an opening for me.</i></b>

05:47.572 --> 05:49.692
<b>Everyone, get behind me!</b>

05:49.692 --> 05:51.422
<b>I'm a dungeon boss, too—</b>

05:51.832 --> 05:53.322
<b>You stay here!</b>

05:58.882 --> 06:01.182
<b>Where did Chlo-chi go?</b>

06:01.182 --> 06:03.822
<b>For real! Just because she's 
strong is no reason to...</b>

06:03.822 --> 06:06.072
<b>I wish we could go look for her...</b>

06:07.072 --> 06:09.232
<b>What now?!</b>

06:10.372 --> 06:12.732
<b>You still refuse to admit defeat?</b>

06:13.092 --> 06:15.062
<b>Then I will end it here.</b>

06:15.062 --> 06:18.732
<b>I will defeat you and join Gran.</b>

06:19.152 --> 06:21.112
<b>You think I'm going to let you?</b>

06:22.242 --> 06:23.612
<b>Death Storm!</b>

06:26.982 --> 06:28.512
<b><i>Some sort of force field?</i></b>

06:28.512 --> 06:31.282
<b><i>None of my magic has been 
reaching him at all.</i></b>

06:31.282 --> 06:33.122
<b><i>The same goes for Shion's attacks.</i></b>

06:34.542 --> 06:37.982
<b><i>Is that exoskeleton tougher 
than steel or what?</i></b>

06:47.892 --> 06:49.752
<b><i>What incredible force...</i></b>

06:49.752 --> 06:52.732
<b><i>I can't even escape it when 
I evade using Ultra Instinct.</i></b>

06:52.732 --> 06:56.482
<b><i>So this is what an Insect in 
its final form is capable of...</i></b>

07:00.142 --> 07:02.782
<b>I heard about Maribel.</b>

07:03.092 --> 07:05.572
<b>You are ready to make 
your final wager, yes?</b>

07:06.322 --> 07:07.232
<b>Yes.</b>

07:07.902 --> 07:11.412
<b>She reminded me of Maria a bit.</b>

07:12.942 --> 07:14.432
<b>Agreed.</b>

07:15.382 --> 07:20.922
<b>With her gone, there is no one 
else worthy of being my successor.</b>

07:21.472 --> 07:25.342
<b>Even I cannot live forever.</b>

07:26.362 --> 07:30.932
<b><i>To think that Gran's hope has been lost,</i></b>

07:31.612 --> 07:35.482
<b><i>after he fought back against 
hardship after hardship</i></b>

07:35.482 --> 07:39.602
<b><i>and was so close to achieving 
his dream of so many years...</i></b>

07:41.212 --> 07:44.362
<b>Gran, you will make your 
wish come true, yes?</b>

07:47.842 --> 07:51.832
<b>My path is forever by your side,</b>

07:51.832 --> 07:54.682
<b>no matter where that may lead me.</b>

07:55.772 --> 08:00.752
<b>As I told you, you are 
the only one I trust.</b>

08:01.622 --> 08:04.512
<b><i>You can count on me, Gran.</i></b>

08:05.452 --> 08:11.812
<b><i>I will not allow anyone to get in 
the way of your—no, our dream.</i></b>

08:14.312 --> 08:17.252
<b>Ranga, take a break for a while.</b>

08:17.252 --> 08:19.142
<b>I've got Ultraspeed Regeneration.</b>

08:19.142 --> 08:21.382
<b>Don't be ridiculous! That thing is strong!</b>

08:21.382 --> 08:23.662
<b>We've been fighting him 
together, and look at us!</b>

08:23.662 --> 08:26.402
<b>It's all right. 
I think I'm figuring him out.</b>

08:26.402 --> 08:30.202
<b>Save your strength until 
I give you the signal.</b>

08:32.242 --> 08:33.202
<b>Understood.</b>

08:33.872 --> 08:35.752
<b>Your resolve is admirable.</b>

08:35.752 --> 08:39.152
<b>I'll strip you of that confidence!</b>

08:39.882 --> 08:41.092
<b>Oh?</b>

08:41.512 --> 08:43.862
<b><i>My Wicked Oni skill, Oni Berserker.</i></b>

08:42.842 --> 08:44.382
<b>Oni Berserker</b>

08:44.382 --> 08:50.142
<b><i>The burden of boosting my strength, 
stamina, and spirit is immense.</i></b>

08:51.712 --> 08:54.472
<b><i>I need to finish this 
before I lose my sanity!</i></b>

09:05.232 --> 09:08.152
<b><i>I can't go down now.</i></b>

09:08.592 --> 09:12.622
<b><i>If I die now, our chances of winning 
this battle will drop severely.</i></b>

09:13.532 --> 09:16.082
<b><i>Even if I can't win, I can buy time.</i></b>

09:16.442 --> 09:18.502
<b><i>I need to keep him here!</i></b>

09:20.422 --> 09:23.182
<b><i>All that matters is that I stay alive.</i></b>

09:23.182 --> 09:26.542
<b><i>That said, I have no 
intention of giving up!</i></b>

09:26.542 --> 09:28.922
<b><i>I will win and earn Great Rimuru's praise!</i></b>

09:33.342 --> 09:34.442
<b>Shion?</b>

09:37.932 --> 09:39.602
<b>Mere child's play!</b>

09:47.362 --> 09:50.952
<b><i>Shion's technique has clearly 
increased since this battle began.</i></b>

09:50.952 --> 09:53.912
<b><i>She relied solely on her 
strength before, but now...</i></b>

09:53.912 --> 09:56.292
<b>I'm not done! 
I've still got much more in me!</b>

09:59.002 --> 10:01.962
<b><i>My unique skill, Master Chef.</i></b>

10:01.962 --> 10:03.442
<b><i>No matter how tough he is,</i></b>

10:03.442 --> 10:06.722
<b><i>its Certain Outcome can bend 
the rules until he breaks!</i></b>

10:08.762 --> 10:12.262
<b><i>I have one goal: 
to destroy his exoskeleton!</i></b>

10:13.572 --> 10:15.012
<b><i>Even after all this...</i></b>

10:15.012 --> 10:16.472
<b>Shion, I'll join you!</b>

10:16.472 --> 10:17.972
<b>No, not yet!</b>

10:18.382 --> 10:19.482
<b>Foolish.</b>

10:36.492 --> 10:37.462
<b>Shion!</b>

10:38.982 --> 10:41.022
<b>Admit defeat.</b>

10:41.022 --> 10:43.712
<b>Are you ready to submit to me now?</b>

10:46.412 --> 10:47.672
<b>Don't make me laugh.</b>

10:47.672 --> 10:48.982
<b>What?</b>

10:48.982 --> 10:51.452
<b>Submit to you?</b>

10:51.452 --> 10:55.092
<b>I aspire to reach even greater heights.</b>

10:55.512 --> 10:56.592
<b>What are you...</b>

10:57.192 --> 10:59.792
<b>You are one clueless bug.</b>

10:59.792 --> 11:04.102
<b>I'm saying that I will surpass you!</b>

11:09.912 --> 11:13.862
<b>Your attacks simply are 
not enough to affect me.</b>

11:14.522 --> 11:16.912
<b>Admit that you are weak.</b>

11:18.012 --> 11:21.122
<b>And the weak can accomplish nothing.</b>

11:24.062 --> 11:28.502
<b><i>Yes, it's true. You're right.</i></b>

11:29.502 --> 11:31.552
<b><i>I am weak.</i></b>

11:35.512 --> 11:39.872
<b><i>As an Ogre, I always 
believed might made right.</i></b>

11:42.822 --> 11:44.692
<b><i>Weak ones die.</i></b>

11:44.692 --> 11:47.402
<b><i>Among monsters, that's to be expected.</i></b>

11:47.902 --> 11:48.942
<b><i>That's why</i></b>

11:48.942 --> 11:55.402
<b><i>Great Rimuru's rule of never looking down
on other races resonated with me.</i></b>

11:57.402 --> 12:00.952
<b><i>But when I died, I felt the fear 
of being killed for the first time.</i></b>

12:01.552 --> 12:04.872
<b><i>And then Great Rimuru saved me.</i></b>

12:05.392 --> 12:07.692
<b><i>The relief I felt then...</i></b>

12:08.962 --> 12:11.882
<b>Listen, Shion. What's important is...</b>

12:13.342 --> 12:16.262
<b><i>...knowing where your soul is.</i></b>

12:18.272 --> 12:23.782
<b>Great Rimuru said that the worth of your 
soul is determined by how you live.</b>

12:23.782 --> 12:27.942
<b>That whether you're strong 
or weak means nothing.</b>

12:28.242 --> 12:30.442
<b>So behold how I choose to live!</b>

12:37.792 --> 12:39.642
<b><i>It's so pathetic.</i></b>

12:39.642 --> 12:43.942
<b><i>There were times when I felt uncertain 
because I am inferior to Diablo.</i></b>

12:44.402 --> 12:49.472
<b><i>I thought Great Rimuru might toss me 
out someday because I lacked strength.</i></b>

12:49.472 --> 12:52.282
<b>That is what weakness is to me!</b>

12:57.002 --> 12:59.432
<b>What use is there in envying others?</b>

12:59.432 --> 13:01.872
<b>It is myself I should be focusing on!</b>

13:01.872 --> 13:03.972
<b>I must overcome myself!</b>

13:05.112 --> 13:06.622
<b><i>Confirmed.</i></b>

13:06.622 --> 13:09.932
<b><i>The individual named Shion's 
intrinsic skill Oni Berserker</i></b>

13:08.812 --> 13:10.642
<b>Oni Berserker</b>

13:09.932 --> 13:13.482
<b><i>has evolved into the unique 
skill Divine Berserker.</i></b>

13:11.062 --> 13:13.482
<b>Divine Berserker</b>

13:14.952 --> 13:16.062
<b>Here I come!</b>

13:31.782 --> 13:34.972
<b>This is futile. 
My exoskeleton cannot be—</b>

13:34.972 --> 13:36.232
<b>Shut up!</b>

13:36.232 --> 13:38.392
<b>I'm going to teach you something:</b>

13:38.392 --> 13:42.672
<b>the goddess of victory smiles upon the 
one who doesn't give up until the end!</b>

13:42.672 --> 13:43.492
<b>Here I come!</b>

13:43.492 --> 13:45.912
<b>Divine Release!</b>

13:51.072 --> 13:52.582
<b><i>The pressure is immense...</i></b>

13:53.102 --> 13:54.462
<b><i>but it's nothing to me!</i></b>

13:55.042 --> 13:55.922
<b>Ranga!</b>

13:55.922 --> 13:57.112
<b>Understood!</b>

14:07.892 --> 14:09.392
<b>Insolence!</b>

14:11.172 --> 14:13.062
<b>Chaotic Fate!</b>

14:38.462 --> 14:39.222
<b>Now!</b>

14:39.222 --> 14:39.922
<b>I'm on it!</b>

14:43.552 --> 14:46.362
<b><i>Just wait, Chloe, Hinata!</i></b>

14:46.362 --> 14:49.862
<b><i>I swear I'm going to save your souls!</i></b>

15:34.012 --> 15:36.402
<b><i>I am sorry, Gran.</i></b>

15:37.182 --> 15:38.942
<b><i>It seems this is the end for me.</i></b>

15:39.752 --> 15:41.942
<b><i>I will die first.</i></b>

15:43.602 --> 15:47.162
<b>We shall meet again at 
the promised location...</b>

15:52.952 --> 15:53.702
<b>Shion!</b>

15:54.702 --> 15:57.532
<b>Ranga, we still have to—</b>

16:17.252 --> 16:21.062
<b>The world is constantly 
trampling upon my wish.</b>

16:21.062 --> 16:25.222
<b>Even now, I have lost yet another friend.</b>

16:25.222 --> 16:26.692
<b>You mean Razul?</b>

16:28.862 --> 16:32.852
<b>So all I need to do now 
is destroy this world.</b>

16:32.852 --> 16:34.662
<b>Don't be ridiculous!</b>

16:34.662 --> 16:37.802
<b>If you want to despair, do it on your own!</b>

16:37.802 --> 16:39.082
<b>Despair?</b>

16:39.622 --> 16:42.132
<b>Why, not at all.</b>

16:52.412 --> 16:54.092
<b>In this very moment,</b>

16:54.092 --> 16:58.892
<b>my heart has been filled 
to the brim with hope.</b>

17:10.512 --> 17:16.202
<b><i>Now is the time to fulfill my promise 
to my friends and loved ones.</i></b>

17:17.652 --> 17:21.202
<b><i>Confirmed. Conditions met.</i></b>

17:20.982 --> 17:23.392
<b>Indomitable</b>

17:21.202 --> 17:24.342
<b><i>The individual named Granville 
Rozzo's skill Indomitable</i></b>

17:22.602 --> 17:26.632
<b>Sariel</b>

17:24.342 --> 17:27.942
<b><i>has evolved into the 
ultimate skill Sariel.</i></b>

17:29.272 --> 17:30.882
<b>Hope?</b>

17:31.202 --> 17:34.892
<b>Yes. My preparations are complete.</b>

17:37.822 --> 17:39.922
<b><i>You must have done it, Rimuru.</i></b>

17:39.922 --> 17:42.572
<b><i>All I can do now is believe in you.</i></b>

17:47.392 --> 17:52.662
<b>Lady Luminus, let us at last cut our 
ties and settle this once and for all.</b>

17:52.662 --> 17:58.122
<b>Indeed. I will see for myself 
just how prepared you are.</b>

17:58.122 --> 18:01.852
<b>And do not worry. 
I will be certain to kill you.</b>

18:02.372 --> 18:05.782
<b><i>My Asmodeus and Gran's Sariel...</i></b>

18:05.782 --> 18:09.602
<b><i>It is likely they both 
command life and death.</i></b>

18:09.602 --> 18:14.172
<b><i>When the conditions are the 
same, the stronger will wins.</i></b>

18:14.172 --> 18:15.802
<b><i>This will be over in an instant.</i></b>

18:27.312 --> 18:29.612
<b>Memory End Requiem!</b>

18:27.332 --> 18:29.542
<b>Memory End Requiem</b>

18:32.462 --> 18:34.372
<b>Fortitude!</b>

18:49.542 --> 18:54.132
<b>Well done, Lady Luminus...</b>

19:14.182 --> 19:17.542
<b>Am I inside Chronoa's mental realm?</b>

19:20.392 --> 19:24.412
<b>That's... what I want, right? 
I managed to get in?</b>

19:29.512 --> 19:32.842
<b>Where the heck am I 
supposed to go, though?</b>

19:33.352 --> 19:34.162
<b>Hey.</b>

19:35.752 --> 19:37.972
<b>It's been a long time, Slime-san.</b>

19:37.972 --> 19:40.092
<b>Rather... Satoru-san, right?</b>

19:40.092 --> 19:41.652
<b>Shizu-san!</b>

19:43.372 --> 19:47.522
<b><i>Oh, I get it. This is all a mentalscape.</i></b>

19:48.352 --> 19:52.402
<b>Aw, cut it out. My name is Rimuru now.</b>

19:52.402 --> 19:56.622
<b>I'm not throwing away my past, 
but it's embarrassing being called that.</b>

19:58.422 --> 20:00.072
<b>Well, shall we?</b>

20:00.072 --> 20:00.772
<b>Huh?</b>

20:05.482 --> 20:07.182
<b><i>She really is pretty.</i></b>

20:08.952 --> 20:11.372
<b>You came to see her, didn't you?</b>

20:11.992 --> 20:13.632
<b>Chronoa?!</b>

20:14.362 --> 20:16.392
<b>Can she talk?</b>

20:16.392 --> 20:19.892
<b>In the real world, she lost her 
sense of self and went on a rampage.</b>

20:19.892 --> 20:20.762
<b>Go on.</b>

20:21.832 --> 20:24.052
<b>Right. We should try talking first.</b>

20:28.732 --> 20:29.762
<b>Chronoa?</b>

20:34.132 --> 20:36.072
<b>Are you... Rimuru?</b>

20:36.072 --> 20:37.822
<b>Y-Yeah.</b>

20:38.122 --> 20:40.382
<b>Is it really you?</b>

20:40.382 --> 20:43.812
<b>Yeah. I'm definitely the real Rimuru-san.</b>

20:44.482 --> 20:45.332
<b>Rimuru!</b>

20:52.782 --> 20:54.962
<b><i>This isn't what I imagined...</i></b>

20:54.962 --> 20:57.862
<b><i>I thought she'd be more antagonistic.</i></b>

20:58.492 --> 20:59.592
<b><i>That said...</i></b>

20:59.592 --> 21:03.762
<b><i>I like the idea of a cute girl 
who'll hug a slime!</i></b>

21:07.092 --> 21:09.392
<b>You accomplished so much.</b>

21:09.922 --> 21:12.522
<b>I wish I could've met you, Hero.</b>

21:13.832 --> 21:14.662
<b>Yeah.</b>

21:15.512 --> 21:17.982
<b><i>She does seem more like Chloe.</i></b>

21:17.982 --> 21:21.512
<b><i>I guess she really is 
Chloe's grown-up form.</i></b>

21:21.512 --> 21:24.122
<b><i>I'm curious why she went 
on a rampage, though...</i></b>

21:25.072 --> 21:27.912
<b>Um... Chronoa, was it?</b>

21:27.912 --> 21:30.662
<b>Yeah. I'm Chronoa.</b>

21:30.662 --> 21:35.222
<b>The "avatar of destruction" 
that was sealed within Chloe,</b>

21:35.222 --> 21:39.332
<b>and at the same time, 
a sort of second personality.</b>

21:39.332 --> 21:45.052
<b>I don't think I would've had such a sense 
of self if Hinata hadn't named me, though.</b>

21:45.052 --> 21:47.202
<b>I-I see.</b>

21:47.202 --> 21:51.242
<b><i>I actually don't get it, but it sounds 
like things are kinda complicated.</i></b>

21:51.242 --> 21:55.062
<b>Listen, I came here looking 
for Chloe and Hinata.</b>

21:56.102 --> 21:57.832
<b>Could I see them?</b>

22:00.492 --> 22:02.322
<b>That won't work.</b>

22:02.322 --> 22:03.722
<b>Why not?</b>

22:04.322 --> 22:10.932
<b>Chloe is lost in the Unlimited
Imprisonment deep inside me.</b>

22:11.622 --> 22:13.972
<b>And Hinata...</b>

22:15.262 --> 22:19.412
<b>Hinata is already dead.</b>

22:22.612 --> 22:23.452
<b>What?</b>

23:55.182 --> 23:57.862
<b><i>Next time, "The Hero Awakens."</i></b>

23:55.872 --> 23:59.962
<b>The Hero <u>Awakens</u></b>
